## Starter kit — Web (Forge)

This app was scaffolded with the **Web** kit: Prism + Conduit auth UI with
Jetstream-class depth (email verification, password reset, profile, 2FA,
teams, notifications shell).

- Brand theme **Forge** (teal + chartreuse) with light/dark via `class="dark"`
- Fonts: **Outfit** + JetBrains Mono (same as Progress)
- Authenticated chrome: sidebar (Dashboard, Notifications, Settings, Teams)
- Interactive islands via Conduit (`@conduit('theme_toggle')`)
- After migrate: register → verify email → enable 2FA under Settings
